| Column Name                          | Description                                                     |
| ------------------------------------ | --------------------------------------------------------------- |
| source_pdf                           | Original PDF file name or relative path                         |
| claim_number                         | Insurance claim identification number                           |
| hvaci_file_number                    | HVACi file number or iCheck number                              |
| report_date                          | Date the HVACi report was generated                             |
| date_of_loss                         | Date on which the loss occurred                                 |
| insured_name                         | Name of the insured person                                      |
| loss_address                         | Address where the loss occurred                                 |
| company                              | Insurance company associated with the claim                     |
| insured_stated_cause_of_loss         | Cause of loss reported by the insured                           |
| cause_of_loss                        | Cause of loss identified by HVACi                               |
| equipment_description                | Description of the HVAC equipment                               |
| manufacturer                         | Equipment manufacturer                                          |
| model_number                         | Equipment model number                                          |
| serial_number                        | Equipment serial number                                         |
| equipment_year                       | Year the equipment was manufactured                             |
| equipment_age                        | Approximate age of the equipment                                |
| failure_component                    | Component identified as failed or damaged                       |
| findings                             | Inspection findings describing equipment damage                 |
| system_recommendation                | Overall recommendation to repair or replace the HVAC system     |
| recommended_action                   | Specific repair or replacement work recommended                 |
| replacement_required                 | Indicates whether full HVAC system replacement is required      |
| recommendation_details               | Explanation supporting the repair or replacement recommendation |
| insured_quote_total                  | Total amount quoted by the insured's contractor                 |
| market_pricing_total                 | Total HVACi market pricing or LKQ replacement cost              |
| parts_cost                           | Total parts or material cost                                    |
| labor_hours                          | Total estimated labor hours                                     |
| labor_cost                           | Total estimated labor cost                                      |
| recommended_cost_before_depreciation | Total recommended cost before depreciation                      |
| depreciation                         | Amount deducted for depreciation                                |
| recommended_acv_after_depreciation   | Actual cash value after depreciation                            |
| pricing_variance                     | Difference between insured quote and market pricing             |
| pricing_variance_percentage          | Percentage difference between insured quote and market pricing  |
| sales_tax                            | Applicable sales tax                                            |
| labor_rate                           | Estimated labor rate per hour                                   |
| pages_processed                      | Total number of PDF pages processed                             |
| source_page_numbers                  | PDF page numbers from which information was extracted           |
| extraction_status                    | Overall extraction status (OK or REVIEW)                        |
| missing_fields                       | Fields that could not be extracted                              |
| warnings                             | Extraction or validation warnings                               |
| extracted_text_file                  | Location of the extracted PDF text file                         |
